{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05329","headline":"奉和幸上官昭容院献诗四首 二 · 郑愔","name":"奉和幸上官昭容院献诗四首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尧茨姑射近，汉苑建章连。\n十五蓂知月，三千桃纪年。\n鸾歌随凤吹，鹤舞向鵾弦。\n更觅琼妃伴，来过玉女泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}